IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cat-domain`
IMPORT `cat-time`
IMPORT `cat-part1-preliminary`
IMPORT `cat-part2-div2-3-microchip-sterilise`
IMPORT `cat-part2-div1-registration`
IMPORT `tests-fixtures`

-- TESTS — Part 2 Division 1 (ss 5-13) and Cat Regulations 2012 regs 9-16.
-- Expected values are worked from the source; the working is beside each.

§ `Tests — registration and tagging`

§§ `Local cats for these tests`

-- An adult cat (born 1 Jan 2024), chipped and desexed, kept by Alex since
-- the day given, unregistered, with the custodian and foster placement given.
GIVEN start     IS A DATE
      custodian IS A MAYBE Custodian
      foster    IS A MAYBE `Foster placement`
GIVETH A Cat
`an adult cat kept by Alex since` start `, in the custody of` custodian `, fostered` foster MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Sox"
        `date of birth`                            IS YMD 2024 1 1
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS TRUE
        `date of death`                            IS NOTHING
        `registration`                             IS NOTHING
        `registered with another local government since` IS FALSE
        `implanted device`                         IS JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS NOTHING
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS NOTHING
        `keepings`                                 IS LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` start
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS custodian
        `foster placement`                         IS foster
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS FALSE
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE

GIVEN o IS AN Organisation
      w IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Foster placement`
`fostered by` o `for` w `weeks` MEANS
    JUST (`Foster placement` WITH `placed by` IS o, `total weeks in foster care` IS w)

-- Alex's cat, registered with the City of Stirling though kept in Perth.
`Alex's cat registered in the wrong district` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `registered` (JUST (`registered with` "City of Stirling" `to` "Alex" `for` `one year` `from` (YMD 2025 11 1)))
        `chipped` (JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))
        `desexed` (JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))

§§ `s 5 — cats to be registered`

-- An adult, unregistered cat kept by Alex for well over 14 days: contravened.
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's unregistered cat`
-- Registered with the district's local government: not contravened.
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`
-- "registered with the local government in whose district the cat is
-- ordinarily kept": registered elsewhere does not discharge it.
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's cat registered in the wrong district`
-- Carl does not own Alex's cat (s 4).
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Carl` `as to` `Alex's unregistered cat`
-- "a cat that has reached 6 months of age": the August kitten (born 31 Aug
-- 2025) reaches 6 months on 1 Mar 2026 (Interpretation Act s 62(3) example).
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2026 2 28) `by` `Alex` `as to` `the August kitten`
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2026 3 1)  `by` `Alex` `as to` `the August kitten`
-- (2)(a) kept by the person for less than 14 days (fork F-06: whole days
-- from the start): kept since 20 Nov 2025 — 13 days on 3 Dec, 14 on 4 Dec.
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 3) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2025 11 20) `, in the custody of` NOTHING `, fostered` NOTHING)
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 4) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2025 11 20) `, in the custody of` NOTHING `, fostered` NOTHING)
-- (2)(b) resident in the State for less than 14 days: Newcomer arrived on
-- 20 Nov 2025 and has kept a cat since 1 Nov.
`Newcomer's cat` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Newcomer` `since` (YMD 2025 11 1))
        `registered` NOTHING `chipped` NOTHING `desexed` NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 3) `by` `Newcomer` `as to` `Newcomer's cat`
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 4) `by` `Newcomer` `as to` `Newcomer's cat`
-- (2)(c), reg 9(2): in the custody of the RSPCA WA, of a cat management
-- facility, of veterinary premises — exempt; of a private person — not.
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST (`an organisation` `The Royal Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Animals, Western Australia`)) `, fostered` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST (`an organisation` `the Commonwealth Department administering the Biosecurity Act 2015`)) `, fostered` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST `a cat management facility`) `, fostered` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST `veterinary premises`) `, fostered` NOTHING)
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST `a private person`) `, fostered` NOTHING)
-- reg 9(2) lists Cat Haven but not a SAFE entity as a custodian.
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST (`an organisation` `S.A.F.E. Hedland Inc`)) `, fostered` NOTHING)
-- reg 9(3)(a): fostered by Cat Haven — no week limit.
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` NOTHING `, fostered` (`fostered by` `Cat Welfare Society Inc., trading as Cat Haven` `for` 30 `weeks`))
-- reg 9(3)(b): by a SAFE entity, "not ... more than a total of 12 weeks".
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` NOTHING `, fostered` (`fostered by` `Saving Animals from Euthanasia Busselton Inc` `for` 12 `weeks`))
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` NOTHING `, fostered` (`fostered by` `Saving Animals from Euthanasia Busselton Inc` `for` 13 `weeks`))
-- Fostered by a body reg 9 does not name: not exempt.
#ASSERT     `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` NOTHING `, fostered` (`fostered by` `another organisation` `for` 2 `weeks`))
-- The penalty is a ceiling.
#ASSERT `s 5(1) — maximum fine` EQUALS 5000
-- Before 25 September 2025 the encoding has no source.
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 5(1) is contravened on` (YMD 2025 9 1) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's unregistered cat`

§§ `s 6 — cats to wear tags`

GIVEN day     IS A DATE
      public  IS A BOOLEAN
      tagged  IS A BOOLEAN
      shown   IS A MAYBE `Show organiser`
GIVETH AN Occasion
`an occasion on` day `, public:` public `, tagged:` tagged `, shown by` shown MEANS
    Occasion WITH `date` IS day, `in a public place` IS public, `wearing its registration tag` IS tagged, `being exhibited at a show held by` IS shown

#ASSERT     `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` TRUE  `, tagged:` FALSE `, shown by` NOTHING) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` TRUE  `, tagged:` TRUE  `, shown by` NOTHING) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` FALSE `, tagged:` FALSE `, shown by` NOTHING) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`
-- s 6(1) speaks of "a registered cat": an unregistered one breaks s 5, not s 6.
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` TRUE  `, tagged:` FALSE `, shown by` NOTHING) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's unregistered cat`
-- reg 10: exhibited at a show held by one of the four bodies (a)-(d), or an
-- affiliate (e) — exempt; by anyone else — not.
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` TRUE  `, tagged:` FALSE `, shown by` (JUST (`one of the cat fancy bodies` `Cats United WA Incorporated`))) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT NOT `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` TRUE  `, tagged:` FALSE `, shown by` (JUST (`a body affiliated with` `Australian National Cats Incorporated`))) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`
#ASSERT     `s 6(1) is contravened on` (`an occasion on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, public:` TRUE  `, tagged:` FALSE `, shown by` (JUST `another show organiser`)) `by` `Alex` `as to` `Alex's registered cat`

GIVEN other    IS A BOOLEAN
      accident IS A BOOLEAN
      beyond   IS A BOOLEAN
      care     IS A BOOLEAN
      diligent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Section 6(3) findings`
`findings:` other `,` accident `,` beyond `,` care `,` diligent MEANS
    `Section 6(3) findings` WITH
        `due to the act or default of another person`         IS other
        `due to an accident`                                   IS accident
        `due to some other cause beyond the accused's control` IS beyond
        `took reasonable precautions`                          IS care
        `could not by due diligence have prevented it`         IS diligent

-- (a)(ii) an accident AND (b) both limbs: established.
#ASSERT     `the s 6(3) defence is established` (`findings:` FALSE `,` TRUE  `,` FALSE `,` TRUE  `,` TRUE)
-- (a) without (b): "and" — not established.
#ASSERT NOT `the s 6(3) defence is established` (`findings:` TRUE  `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the s 6(3) defence is established` (`findings:` TRUE  `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE  `,` FALSE)
-- (b) without any cause in (a): not established.
#ASSERT NOT `the s 6(3) defence is established` (`findings:` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE  `,` TRUE)

§§ `s 7 — interference with a tag`

#ASSERT     `s 7 is contravened, where the person` TRUE  `and the excuse is` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 7 is contravened, where the person` TRUE  `and the excuse is` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 7 is contravened, where the person` FALSE `and the excuse is` FALSE

§§ `s 8 — who may apply`

#ASSERT     `may apply on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `under s 8 by` `Alex` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `to` "City of Perth"
#ASSERT NOT `may apply on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `under s 8 by` `Alex` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `to` "City of Stirling"
#ASSERT NOT `may apply on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `under s 8 by` `Carl` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `to` "City of Perth"

§§ `s 9 — the determination`

GIVEN who IS A Person
      g   IS A `Grant or renewal`
      m   IS A DATE
      dd  IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Registration application`
`an application by` who `for` g `made` m `decided` dd MEANS
    `Registration application` WITH
        `applicant`        IS who
        `grant or renewal` IS g
        `term applied for` IS `one year`
        `date made`        IS m
        `date determined`  IS dd

`Alex applies` MEANS `an application by` `Alex` `for` `a grant` `made` (YMD 2025 12 1) `decided` (YMD 2025 12 5)

-- A microchipped, sterilised adult cat; an adult applicant with no convictions:
-- no ground in s 9(2) applies, so the local government must grant.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`

-- (a), (c) and (d): Bea, 13, applies for her unchipped, entire cat.
`Bea's cat` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Bea` `since` (YMD 2025 1 1))
        `registered` NOTHING `chipped` NOTHING `desexed` NOTHING
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by` `Bea` `for` `a grant` `made` (YMD 2025 12 1) `decided` (YMD 2025 12 5)) `for` `Bea's cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Bea`, `Carl`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must refuse the application` (LIST "(a) the applicant is a child under 18 years of age", "(c) the cat is not microchipped", "(d) the cat is not sterilised")

-- (c) and (d) for a kitten under 6 months: no s 14(2) or s 18(2)
-- exemption can apply under 6 months (ss 14(3), 18(3)), so refusal is
-- mandatory (fork F-09).
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `the August kitten` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must refuse the application` (LIST "(c) the cat is not microchipped", "(d) the cat is not sterilised")

-- s 9(3): not microchipped, but an adult cat with a veterinary certificate
-- under s 14(2) — must not be refused on (c).
`the cat with a microchipping certificate` MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Fluff"
        `date of birth`                            IS YMD 2024 1 1
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS TRUE
        `date of death`                            IS NOTHING
        `registration`                             IS NOTHING
        `registered with another local government since` IS FALSE
        `implanted device`                         IS NOTHING
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS JUST `a vet certificate`
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS NOTHING
        `keepings`                                 IS LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS NOTHING
        `foster placement`                         IS NOTHING
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS FALSE
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `the cat with a microchipping certificate` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`

-- s 9(4) with s 18(2)(a): an adult entire cat with a sterilisation certificate.
`the cat with a sterilisation certificate` MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Smudge"
        `date of birth`                            IS YMD 2024 1 1
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS TRUE
        `date of death`                            IS NOTHING
        `registration`                             IS NOTHING
        `registered with another local government since` IS FALSE
        `implanted device`                         IS JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS NOTHING
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS NOTHING
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS JUST `a vet certificate`
        `keepings`                                 IS LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS NOTHING
        `foster placement`                         IS NOTHING
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS FALSE
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `the cat with a sterilisation certificate` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`

-- s 9(4) with s 18(2)(b): an entire breeding cat owned by an approved breeder.
`Fay` MEANS `a breeder named` "Fay" `, member of` (LIST `Cat Owners' Association of Western Australia Incorporated`) `, convicted` EMPTY `, noticed` EMPTY `, approved:` TRUE
`Fay's queen` MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Queenie"
        `date of birth`                            IS YMD 2024 1 1
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS TRUE
        `date of death`                            IS NOTHING
        `registration`                             IS NOTHING
        `registered with another local government since` IS FALSE
        `implanted device`                         IS JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS NOTHING
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS NOTHING
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS NOTHING
        `keepings`                                 IS LIST `kept by` `Fay` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS NOTHING
        `foster placement`                         IS NOTHING
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS TRUE
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by` `Fay` `for` `a grant` `made` (YMD 2025 12 1) `decided` (YMD 2025 12 5)) `for` `Fay's queen` `, its owners among` (LIST `Fay`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`

-- (b): a cat in the custody of Cat Haven is of a class exempt from registration.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` (`an adult cat kept by Alex since` (YMD 2024 3 1) `, in the custody of` (JUST (`an organisation` `Cat Welfare Society Inc., trading as Cat Haven`)) `, fostered` NOTHING) `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must refuse the application` (LIST "(b) the cat belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from registration")

-- (e): "convicted within the previous 3 years of 2 or more offences against"
-- the Cat Act, the Dog Act or the Animal Welfare Act.
GIVEN convictions IS A LIST OF Conviction
GIVETH A `Registration application`
`an application by a person convicted` convictions MEANS
    `an application by` (`a person named` "Dora" `born` (YMD 1980 1 1) `convicted` convictions) `for` `a grant` `made` (YMD 2025 12 1) `decided` (YMD 2025 12 5)

`Dora's cat` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` (`a person named` "Dora" `born` (YMD 1980 1 1) `convicted` EMPTY) `since` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `registered` NOTHING
        `chipped` (JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))
        `desexed` (JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))

-- Two in the 3 years (Dog Act 1 Mar 2024, Animal Welfare Act 15 Jan 2025): refuse.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by a person convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2024 3 1) `under` `the Dog Act 1976`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Animal Welfare Act 2002`)) `for` `Dora's cat` `, its owners among` EMPTY `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must refuse the application` (LIST "(e) the applicant has been convicted within the previous 3 years of 2 or more offences against this Act, the Dog Act 1976 or the Animal Welfare Act 2002")
-- One is not "2 or more".
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by a person convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Animal Welfare Act 2002`)) `for` `Dora's cat` `, its owners among` EMPTY `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`
-- One of the two was on 1 Dec 2022, more than 3 years before 5 Dec 2025.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by a person convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2022 12 1) `under` `the Dog Act 1976`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Animal Welfare Act 2002`)) `for` `Dora's cat` `, its owners among` EMPTY `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`
-- A conviction under another written law does not count.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by a person convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2024 3 1) `under` `another written law`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Animal Welfare Act 2002`)) `for` `Dora's cat` `, its owners among` EMPTY `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`
-- Fork F-07: an offence against regulations made under the Cat Act is not an
-- offence "against this Act".
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by a person convicted` (LIST `a regulation conviction on` (YMD 2024 3 1) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`)) `for` `Dora's cat` `, its owners among` EMPTY `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by a person convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2024 3 1) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`)) `for` `Dora's cat` `, its owners among` EMPTY `, after the request` NOTHING EQUALS `the local government must refuse the application` (LIST "(e) the applicant has been convicted within the previous 3 years of 2 or more offences against this Act, the Dog Act 1976 or the Animal Welfare Act 2002")

-- s 9(5)-(6): a request (14 days, within the 21-day cap) not complied with.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` (JUST (`Information request` WITH `days allowed` IS 14, `complied with in time` IS FALSE)) EQUALS `the local government may refuse to consider the application`
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` (JUST (`Information request` WITH `days allowed` IS 14, `complied with in time` IS TRUE)) EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`
-- A "specified time of not more than 21 days": a 30-day request is not one
-- under s 9(5), so not complying with it gives no s 9(6) power.
#ASSERT `the s 9 determination of` `Alex applies` `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` (JUST (`Information request` WITH `days allowed` IS 30, `complied with in time` IS FALSE)) EQUALS `the local government must grant or renew the registration`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the s 9 determination of` (`an application by` `Alex` `for` `a grant` `made` (YMD 2025 9 1) `decided` (YMD 2025 9 5)) `for` `Alex's unregistered cat` `, its owners among` (LIST `Alex`) `, after the request` NOTHING

§§ `reg 12(2)(b) — renewal within the 21 days before 1 November`

-- The 21 days preceding 1 November 2025, not counting 1 November
-- (Interpretation Act s 61(1)(c)): 11 to 31 October.
#ASSERT NOT `a renewal may take effect from the next 1 November, if made on` (YMD 2025 10 10)
#ASSERT     `a renewal may take effect from the next 1 November, if made on` (YMD 2025 10 11)
#ASSERT     `a renewal may take effect from the next 1 November, if made on` (YMD 2025 10 31)
#ASSERT NOT `a renewal may take effect from the next 1 November, if made on` (YMD 2025 11 1)

§§ `s 10 — cancellation`

GIVEN death IS A MAYBE DATE
      instate IS A BOOLEAN
      elsewhere IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Cat
`Alex's registered cat, died` death `, in the State` instate `, registered elsewhere` elsewhere MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Tom"
        `date of birth`                            IS YMD 2024 1 1
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS instate
        `date of death`                            IS death
        `registration`                             IS JUST (`registered with` "City of Perth" `to` "Alex" `for` `the life of the cat` `from` (YMD 2025 11 1))
        `registered with another local government since` IS elsewhere
        `implanted device`                         IS JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS NOTHING
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS NOTHING
        `keepings`                                 IS LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1)
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS NOTHING
        `foster placement`                         IS NOTHING
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS FALSE
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the local government may cancel the registration of` (`Alex's registered cat, died` NOTHING `, in the State` TRUE `, registered elsewhere` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, its owner being` `Alex`
#ASSERT     `the local government may cancel the registration of` (`Alex's registered cat, died` (JUST (YMD 2025 11 15)) `, in the State` TRUE `, registered elsewhere` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, its owner being` `Alex`   -- (a)(i)
#ASSERT     `the local government may cancel the registration of` (`Alex's registered cat, died` NOTHING `, in the State` FALSE `, registered elsewhere` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, its owner being` `Alex`                -- (a)(ii)
#ASSERT     `the local government may cancel the registration of` (`Alex's registered cat, died` NOTHING `, in the State` TRUE `, registered elsewhere` TRUE) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, its owner being` `Alex`                 -- (a)(iii)
-- (b): 2 or more convictions "within the period of 12 months before the cancellation".
#ASSERT     `the local government may cancel the registration of` (`Alex's registered cat, died` NOTHING `, in the State` TRUE `, registered elsewhere` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, its owner being` (`a person named` "Alex" `born` (YMD 1980 1 1) `convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 1 15) `under` `the Dog Act 1976`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`))
-- 30 Nov 2024 is outside the 12 months before 1 Dec 2025: only one counts.
#ASSERT NOT `the local government may cancel the registration of` (`Alex's registered cat, died` NOTHING `, in the State` TRUE `, registered elsewhere` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `, its owner being` (`a person named` "Alex" `born` (YMD 1980 1 1) `convicted` (LIST `a conviction on` (YMD 2024 11 30) `under` `the Dog Act 1976`, `a conviction on` (YMD 2025 6 1) `under` `the Cat Act 2011`))

§§ `s 11, reg 15 — tags`

#ASSERT `the colour of the registration tag for` (`registered with` "City of Perth" `to` "Alex" `for` `the life of the cat` `from` (YMD 2025 11 1)) EQUALS `orange`
-- A one-year registration from 1 Nov 2025 expires 31 Oct 2026: the 2026 colour.
#ASSERT `the colour of the registration tag for` (`registered with` "City of Perth" `to` "Alex" `for` `one year` `from` (YMD 2025 11 1)) EQUALS `the colour the Minister has designated for the year of expiry` 2026
#ASSERT `the colour of the registration tag for` (`registered with` "City of Perth" `to` "Alex" `for` `3 years` `from` (YMD 2025 11 1)) EQUALS `the colour the Minister has designated for the year of expiry` 2028

§§ `s 13 — notice of a decision within 7 days`

GIVEN dec   IS A `Reviewable decision`
      on    IS A DATE
      given IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH AN `Objection history`
`a decision` dec `made on` on `, notified on` given MEANS
    `Objection history` WITH
        `decision`                                   IS dec
        `date of the decision`                       IS on
        `date notice of the decision was given`      IS given
        `date objection lodged`                      IS NOTHING
        `further time allowed by the local government, in days` IS 0
        `date notice of disposal of the objection given` IS NOTHING
        `date review applied for`                    IS NOTHING

-- Decision Thu 18 Dec 2025: 7 days end on Christmas Day; Boxing Day and the
-- weekend are excluded too, so the last day is Mon 29 Dec (s 61(1)(e)).
#ASSERT NOT `the s 13 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, for` (`a decision` `refusal to grant registration` `made on` (YMD 2025 12 18) `, notified on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 29))) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `the s 13 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, for` (`a decision` `refusal to grant registration` `made on` (YMD 2025 12 18) `, notified on` (JUST (YMD 2025 12 30))) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT NOT `the s 13 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2025 12 29) `, for` (`a decision` `cancellation of registration` `made on` (YMD 2025 12 18) `, notified on` NOTHING) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
#ASSERT     `the s 13 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2025 12 30) `, for` (`a decision` `cancellation of registration` `made on` (YMD 2025 12 18) `, notified on` NOTHING) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`
-- s 13 covers only the Subdivision 2 decisions; a breeding decision is s 40's.
#ASSERT NOT `the s 13 notice is late, as at` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, for` (`a decision` `refusal to grant an approval to breed` `made on` (YMD 2025 12 18) `, notified on` NOTHING) `given` `WA holidays 2025-26`

#TRACE `s 13 — the local government's duty, counted in days from the decision` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local government` DOES `give notice of the decision, the reasons and the rights of objection and review` AT 6

§§ `reg 13 — moving district`

#ASSERT     `under reg 13, on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `,` `Alex` `may ask to continue the registration of` `Alex's registered cat` `in` "City of Stirling"
#ASSERT NOT `under reg 13, on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `,` `Alex` `may ask to continue the registration of` `Alex's registered cat` `in` "City of Perth"
#ASSERT NOT `under reg 13, on` (YMD 2025 12 1) `,` `Alex` `may ask to continue the registration of` `Alex's unregistered cat` `in` "City of Stirling"
